[{"id":"c08-approval-side-effects","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Agent 应用开发","tags":["Agent 应用开发","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-development/Agent 应用开发(八)工作流与人工审批.md","articleTitle":"Agent 应用开发(八)工作流与人工审批","articlePath":"posts/6cd648d8/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-development/Agent 应用开发(八)工作流与人工审批.md","articleTitle":"Agent 应用开发(八)工作流与人工审批","articlePath":"posts/6cd648d8/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-development/Agent 应用开发(十五)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Agent 应用开发(十五)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/e0031c51/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>当“审批副作用”出现时，先检查哪个状态和边界？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先把“审批副作用”绑定到request与decision；正常、越界和 Unknown 各运行一次，断言副作用计数。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在approval夹具中，比较主体、工具、参数与approve/edit/reject，保留副作用计数；审批通过不等于业务完成；还需查询写入结果、幂等键和审计事件。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"c10-a2a-vs-mcp","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent 应用开发","tags":["Agent 应用开发","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-development/Agent 应用开发(十)多Agent协作.md","articleTitle":"Agent 应用开发(十)多Agent协作","articlePath":"posts/6f6bb3fb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-development/Agent 应用开发(十)多Agent协作.md","articleTitle":"Agent 应用开发(十)多Agent协作","articlePath":"posts/6f6bb3fb/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>“失败传播”的课程边界中，A2A与MCP如何选择？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先把A2A的控制变量设为baseline，把MCP的对照变量设为handoff；在相同样本上分别记录全局状态，再按失败边界作出选择。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>比较A2A与MCP时，不共享缓存或副作用；保存输入、状态转移和独立 Oracle。更多 Agent 可能增加延迟、成本和失败面；没有基线就不能证明增益。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"g03-independent-oracle","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"AI 辅助测试","tags":["AI 辅助测试","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/ai-assisted-testing/AI 辅助测试(三)需求与测试设计.md","articleTitle":"AI 辅助测试(三)需求与测试设计","articlePath":"posts/a2ef184d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/ai-assisted-testing/AI 辅助测试(三)需求与测试设计.md","articleTitle":"AI 辅助测试(三)需求与测试设计","articlePath":"posts/a2ef184d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>当“独立 Oracle”出现时，先检查哪个状态和边界？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先把“独立 Oracle”绑定到ambiguity与coverage；正常、越界和 Unknown 各运行一次，断言验收点。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在design夹具中，比较未定义行为与状态、转移、风险，保留验收点；计划是边界和假设的记录；未决需求要阻断相应结论。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"app-testing-focus-order","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"App测试","tags":["可访问性","焦点"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(九)可用性与可访问性.md","articleTitle":"App测试(九)可用性与可访问性","articlePath":"posts/d4da928f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(九)可用性与可访问性.md","articleTitle":"App测试(九)可用性与可访问性","articlePath":"posts/d4da928f/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>焦点顺序错乱应该怎样复验？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>从已知起点只用键盘或 TalkBack 按任务顺序移动焦点，记录每一步的节点、状态和预期。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>焦点顺序是键盘或 TalkBack 移动控件的顺序，不一定等于屏幕上的视觉顺序。修复后要从固定起点按用户任务逐步移动，复验弹窗打开/关闭、返回页面、错误提示和动态列表更新；焦点不能落到装饰节点或跳过必填控件。失败时保存录屏和语义树 (辅助技术看到的控件结构)，这样才能说明用户在哪一步被阻断。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"app-testing-performance-physical-device","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"App测试","tags":["性能","设备"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(八)稳定性与性能.md","articleTitle":"App测试(八)稳定性与性能","articlePath":"posts/50d100b7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/app-testing/App测试(八)稳定性与性能.md","articleTitle":"App测试(八)稳定性与性能","articlePath":"posts/50d100b7/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么功耗和硬件相关性能必须在真机上复验？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>模拟器不代表真实 SoC、厂商调度、传感器、射频和电池状态，无法直接推出真机功耗与热行为。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>模拟器是在电脑上运行的替代环境，通常不能真实反映手机的 SoC (系统芯片)、电池、温控、传感器和厂商后台策略。它适合比较 API、尺寸和逻辑路径，也能建立启动、渲染、内存的早期趋势；功耗、温度、后台限制和真实输入则必须转到固定条件的真机，并记录设备、亮度、网络和充电状态，才能比较出有意义的结果。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-IP-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["子网计算"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>192.0.2.34/27 的网络地址、广播地址和通常主机范围是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>网络地址是 192.0.2.32，广播地址是 192.0.2.63，通常主机范围是 .33～.62。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>/27 的块大小为 32，34 落入 32～63 块。先计算边界，再讨论特殊用途和点到点例外。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>把计算过程写成可复核的输入输出：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">输入：192.0.2.34/27\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">掩码：255.255.255.224\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">块大小：256 - 224 = 32\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">所在块：32 ～ 63\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">输出：网络 .32，广播 .63，通常主机 .33 ～ .62\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>“通常”保留了点到点链路、特殊用途地址和具体实现的边界；不能把这张表当作所有链路类型的统一答案。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-NET-006","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["广播域","失败边界"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":6,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>分层模型在排障中最有用的产出是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>把现象映射到可验证的层和字段，并明确下一步要观察的证据。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>分层模型最有用的产出是“已确认的边界 + 下一条最小证据 + 尚不能推出的结论”。例如本地网关可达但远端失败，下一步应查路由、NAT、TCP 或 HTTP，而不是反复清理 ARP；收到 404 后，则应转向资源、路由、Host 和应用响应。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>已确认\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>下一步\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>仍不能推出\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>ARP/ND 或 FDB 正常\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查 IP 路由和传输连接\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>整个应用请求成功\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TCP/TLS 握手成功\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查 HTTP 状态和业务数据\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>业务逻辑一定正确\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>HTTP 响应已返回\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查响应字段和应用日志\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>所有用户都能成功\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>这样分层不是背诵更多名词，而是每确认一层就缩小故障搜索范围。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-005","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","状态码"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/"}],"articleIndex":5,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP 状态码 2xx、3xx、4xx、5xx 如何按层次解释？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>2xx 表示成功处理，3xx 表示重定向或条件结果，4xx 表示请求/客户端上下文问题，5xx 表示服务端或网关处理失败。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>状态码首先说明“已经收到 HTTP 响应的这一层发生了什么”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>类别\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>主要含义\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>例子\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>2xx\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>请求被成功处理\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>200\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>201\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>3xx\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>需要重定向或使用缓存条件\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>301\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>304\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>4xx\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务器认为请求或权限有问题\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>400\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>401\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>404\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>5xx\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务器或网关处理失败\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>500\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>502\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>504\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>DNS 失败、TCP 拒绝和 TLS 证书错误通常根本没有 HTTP 状态码；先区分“是否收到响应”，再解释状态码，不能把所有失败都写成 4xx/5xx。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-HTTP-FAQ-002","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","404","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":13,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>看到 404 说明网络不通吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>通常相反：404 说明请求已经到达某个 HTTP 服务并返回了响应，只是目标资源没有按该请求上下文找到。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>网络路径仍可能有代理或路由差异，但应先沿响应头、Host、路径、路由和上游日志定位资源选择。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>状态码首先说明“某个 HTTP 端点如何回应”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">curl -i https://example.test/resource\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>收到 404/401/403 说明至少有 HTTP 响应可观察；资源路由、认证、授权和隐藏资源策略仍需结合响应头、请求上下文和 API 契约判断。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-MOD-FAQ-004","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP/2","HTTP/3","ALPN"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/"}],"articleIndex":12,"articleCount":13,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么同一个网站有时是 h2，有时是 h3？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>客户端能力、Alt-Svc、UDP 可达性、代理/防火墙、QUIC 握手和服务器负载都会影响协议选择。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>同一个网站能走 h2 或 h3，是因为“支持”不等于“本次连接最终协商成功”。客户端可能从 \u003ccode>Alt-Svc\u003c/code> 得知 h3，随后还要验证 UDP/443 可达、QUIC 握手和代理策略；失败后可能回到 TCP 上的 h2。\u003ccode>ALPN\u003c/code> (应用层协议协商) 的结果、QUIC 错误和回退原因才是本次连接的证据。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>证据\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>说明\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>Alt-Svc\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>服务端建议可尝试的协议/端点\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>UDP/QUIC\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>h3 的路径和握手是否成功\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>ALPN\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>TLS/QUIC 最终选出的应用协议\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TCP/TLS\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>回退到 h2/h1 后的连接结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>所以要在同一网络和同一客户端记录最终协议；不能只看站点文档写着“支持 HTTP/3”。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"fastapi-0141-commit-rollback","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["事务","回滚"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务","articlePath":"posts/bbbfc80a/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(八)数据库集成与事务","articlePath":"posts/bbbfc80a/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>事务失败时为什么必须 rollback，而不是只返回错误？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>异常可能留下未完成的事务和脏 Session；rollback 释放数据库状态，保证后续请求看到一致结果。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>一个业务操作可能包含多条 SQL。中途失败而不回滚，连接归还池后仍可能持有锁或让 Session 无法继续执行；捕获异常后应先回滚，再映射稳定的 HTTP 错误。复现实验是让第二条写入故意失败，随后查询确认第一条也没有部分提交。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a3-inode-link","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["inode","链接"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(三)文件与存储管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(三)文件与存储管理","articlePath":"posts/5297e207/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(三)文件与存储管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(三)文件与存储管理","articlePath":"posts/5297e207/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>硬链接和符号链接的核心区别是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>硬链接直接共享 inode；符号链接保存目标路径，目标改名或删除后可能悬空。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>用一个最小目录就能看见两种链接的差异：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> data &gt; original\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ln\u003c/span> original hard\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ln\u003c/span> -s original soft\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ls\u003c/span> -li original hard soft\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>original\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>hard\u003c/code> 的 inode 号相同，\u003ccode>soft\u003c/code> 自己有 inode，内容只是目标路径。删除 \u003ccode>original\u003c/code> 后，\u003ccode>hard\u003c/code> 仍能读取数据，\u003ccode>soft\u003c/code> 则可能变成悬空链接；目录硬链接和跨文件系统硬链接还受文件系统限制。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"a10-retry-needs-deadline","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"AI 大模型应用","tags":["AI 大模型应用","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/llm-application/AI 大模型应用(十)调用可靠性与成本.md","articleTitle":"AI 大模型应用(十)调用可靠性与成本","articlePath":"posts/3955aac0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/llm-application/AI 大模型应用(十)调用可靠性与成本.md","articleTitle":"AI 大模型应用(十)调用可靠性与成本","articlePath":"posts/3955aac0/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/llm-application/AI 大模型应用(十四)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"AI 大模型应用(十四)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8b75caa9/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么重试必须绑定截止时间？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>没有截止时间时，重试可能在超时、撤销或预算耗尽后继续产生不可控结果；两者要在同一个策略中验收。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>测试正常和越界两条路径，保留截止时间、剩余预算和最终状态。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-advanced-quality-gate","type":"choice","priority":3,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["无障碍","质量门"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/4504d456/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十一)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十一)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/4504d456/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>required 的键盘检查被跳过、optional 的视觉检查失败时，质量门应如何判定？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>SKIPPED 不能冒充绿色；optional 失败也应记录和评估，但阻断原因首先来自 required 键盘检查未完成。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>质量门应把状态当作不同信号：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>状态\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>required 检查\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>optional 检查\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>PASS\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可继续\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可继续\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>NOT_APPLICABLE\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>有明确依据时可继续\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>可记录\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>SKIPPED/FAILED\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>阻断\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>记录并评估\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>optional 不是“可以不管”，required 也不能用 SKIPPED 冒充通过；门禁先按信号状态判定，再讨论失败原因。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>通过，因为视觉是 optional\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>自动把键盘检查改为不适用\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>阻断，因为 required 信号不是 PASS 或 NOT_APPLICABLE\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"python-function-default-mutable","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","函数","默认参数","可变性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(五)流程控制与函数.md","articleTitle":"Python(五)流程控制与函数","articlePath":"posts/a62147da/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(五)流程控制与函数.md","articleTitle":"Python(五)流程控制与函数","articlePath":"posts/a62147da/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么不应把 \u003ccode>[]\u003c/code> 或 \u003ccode>{}\u003c/code> 直接作为函数默认参数？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>默认值在函数定义时只创建一次，多次调用会共享同一个可变对象。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>默认表达式在函数定义时求值一次，因此可变对象会成为所有省略该参数的调用共享的状态：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">bad\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">label, labels=[]\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    labels.append(label)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> labels\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(bad(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;a&quot;\u003c/span>))  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [&#x27;a&#x27;]\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(bad(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;b&quot;\u003c/span>))  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># [&#x27;a&#x27;, &#x27;b&#x27;]：同一个默认列表\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>用 \u003ccode>None\u003c/code> 作为哨兵，把创建动作放进函数体：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">good\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">label, labels=\u003cspan class=\"literal\">None\u003c/span>\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">if\u003c/span> labels \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">is\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"literal\">None\u003c/span>:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">        labels = []\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    labels.append(label)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> labels\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>这样每次省略参数都会得到独立列表；调用方显式传入列表时，仍然可以有意识地共享它。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]